      "text": "Find out the shortest path as well as its length\nfrom vertex ' a ' to vertex ' z '",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Find out the shortest path as well as its length from vertex ' a ' to vertex ' z '",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wTGzbwLXO0J_WKsQRoISW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 369.0098467785855,
      "y": 673.8301895638798,
      "width": 642.8134719558993,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1198182378,
      "version": 349,
      "versionNonce": 212021930,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793509238032,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nl ( a ) = 0  , l ( b ) = ♾️ , l ( d ) = ♾️ , l ( e ) = ♾️ , l ( c ) = ♾️ ,\nl ( z ) = ♾️\n\nmin = l ( a ) = 0",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nl ( a ) = 0  , l ( b ) = ♾️ , l ( d ) = ♾️ , l ( e ) = ♾️ , l ( c ) = ♾️ , l ( z ) = ♾️\n\nmin = l ( a ) = 0",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "u09mqG8X63cQUhRKeGqZg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 355.30932305834034,
      "y": 821.7306121643821,
      "width": 606,
      "height": 1550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 155983926,
      "version": 816,
      "versionNonce": 1825524534,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "YX5v0PHqiKyWXSMvxvJyT",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1793510837706,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\nl ( b ) = min ( l ( b ) , l ( a ) + w ( a, b ) )\n        \n        = min ( ♾️ , 0 + 4 ) = 4\n \nl ( d ) = min ( l ( d ) , l ( a ) + w ( a, d ) )\n        \n        = min ( ♾️ , 0 + 2 ) = 2\n\n\n\nStep : 2 \n-----------\n\nl ( b ) = 4 , l ( d ) = 2 , l ( e ) = ♾️ , l ( c ) = ♾️ , l ( z ) = ♾️\n\nmin = l ( d ) = 2\n\n\nl ( e ) = min ( l ( e ) , l ( d ) + w ( d , e ) )\n\n        = min ( ♾️ , 2 + 3 ) = 5\n\n\nstep : 3\n-----------\n\nl ( b ) = 4 , l ( e ) = 5 , l ( c ) = ♾️ , l ( z ) = ♾️\n\nmin = l ( b )\n\nl ( e ) = min ( l ( e ) , l ( b ) + w ( b , e ) )\n\n        = min ( 5 , 4 + 3 ) = 5\n\n\nl ( c ) = min ( l ( c ) , l ( b ) + w ( b , c ) )\n\n        = min ( ♾️ , 4 + 3 ) = 7\n\n\n\n\n step : 4 \n------------\n\n l ( e ) = 5 , l ( c ) = 7 , l ( z ) = ♾️\n\nmin = l ( e )\n\nl ( z ) = min  ( l ( z ) , l ( e ) + w ( e , z ) )\n\n        = min ( ♾️ , 5 + 1 ) = 6\n\n\nstep :  5 \n------------\n\nl ( c ) = 7 , l ( z ) = 6\n\nmin = l ( z ) = 6",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\nl ( b ) = min ( l ( b ) , l ( a ) + w ( a, b ) )\n        \n        = min ( ♾️ , 0 + 4 ) = 4\n \nl ( d ) = min ( l ( d ) , l ( a ) + w ( a, d ) )\n        \n        = min ( ♾️ , 0 + 2 ) = 2\n\n\n\nStep : 2 \n-----------\n\nl ( b ) = 4 , l ( d ) = 2 , l ( e ) = ♾️ , l ( c ) = ♾️ , l ( z ) = ♾️\n\nmin = l ( d ) = 2\n\n\nl ( e ) = min ( l ( e ) , l ( d ) + w ( d , e ) )\n\n        = min ( ♾️ , 2 + 3 ) = 5\n\n\nstep : 3\n-----------\n\nl ( b ) = 4 , l ( e ) = 5 , l ( c ) = ♾️ , l ( z ) = ♾️\n\nmin = l ( b )\n\nl ( e ) = min ( l ( e ) , l ( b ) + w ( b , e ) )\n\n        = min ( 5 , 4 + 3 ) = 5\n\n\nl ( c ) = min ( l ( c ) , l ( b ) + w ( b , c ) )\n\n        = min ( ♾️ , 4 + 3 ) = 7\n\n\n\n\n step : 4 \n------------\n\n l ( e ) = 5 , l ( c ) = 7 , l ( z ) = ♾️\n\nmin = l ( e )\n\nl ( z ) = min  ( l ( z ) , l ( e ) + w ( e , z ) )\n\n        = min ( ♾️ , 5 + 1 ) = 6\n\n\nstep :  5 \n------------\n\nl ( c ) = 7 , l ( z ) = 6\n\nmin = l ( z ) = 6",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
